# Agon Wastes 01_sand_entrance layers 0/2: CFlyerSwarms u041d, u04ff, u05c4, u05c6.
# For tools/cov/specs/swarmbasics_swb19.py (swb19): Touch's three paths and the ctor fixture.
# Phase A (no cannonBall): every beam, its charge shot and the charge combos (sunburst, darkburst,
# sonic boom) so a real CLightComboProjectile and real CEnergyProjectiles hit the swarm; standing
# in the swarm for the plain player touch; morph + boost for kBS_Boost (ballDamage false,
# boosting true). Phase B (cannonBall given): morph ball rolling through the boids so ballDamage
# and cannonBall are both true. Phase C: cannonBall taken away again, standing touches.
@f210 layer 2
@f300 god 1; give morphBall 1; give boostBall 1; give spiderBall 1; give screwAttack 1; give spaceJumpBoots 1; fastmorph 1; give missile 250; give chargeBeam 1; give darkBeam 1; give lightBeam 1; give annihilatorBeam 1; give powerBeam 1; give chargeCombo 1; give sunburst 1; give darkburst 1; give sonicBoom 1; give superMissile 1
@f380 send u041d Activate; send u04ff Activate; send u05c4 Activate; send u05c6 Activate
@f420 tp -338.4 -87.7 -6.7
@f700 obj u041d
@f720 lockon 1
# ---- held charge with the light beam + sunburst owned: releasing a FULLY charged light shot is the
#      only way the gun builds a real CLightComboProjectile (`shoot ... charged` spawns a plain
#      charged beam: run 1 logged no comboed weapon mode at all).
@f740 beam light
@f760 press a 0
@f960 stick 0 0
@f1000 press a 0
@f1200 stick 0 0
@f1100 tp -338.4 -87.7 -6.7
@f1220 press a 0
@f1420 stick 0 0
# ---- power beam: plain, charged, missile
@f740 shoot u041d
@f760 shoot u041d
@f780 shoot u041d charged
@f800 shoot u041d missile
@f820 shoot u041d missile
# ---- dark beam + darkburst
@f840 beam dark
@f860 shoot u041d; shoot u04ff
@f880 shoot u041d charged
@f920 shoot u041d charged
# ---- light beam + sunburst (the CLightComboProjectile arm)
@f960 beam light
@f980 shoot u041d
@f1000 shoot u041d charged
@f1060 tp -338.4 -87.7 -6.7
@f1080 shoot u041d charged
@f1140 shoot u04ff charged
@f1200 shoot u041d charged
# ---- annihilator + sonic boom
@f1260 beam annihilator
@f1280 shoot u041d
@f1300 shoot u041d charged
@f1360 shoot u04ff charged
# ---- standing in the swarm: plain player touch (ballDamage false, boosting false)
@f1420 beam power
@f1440 tp -338.4 -87.7 -6.7
@f1460 noise 6
@f1500 tp -338.4 -87.7 -6.7
# ---- morph + boost, no cannonBall: ballDamage false, boosting true
@f1560 press x 30
@f1600 boost
@f1660 boost
@f1720 tp -338.4 -87.7 -6.7
@f1760 boost
@f1820 press x 30
@f1860 tp -338.4 -87.7 -6.7
# ---- Phase B: cannon ball (ballDamage and cannonBall both true)
@f1900 give cannonBall 1
@f1940 press x 30
@f2000 boost
@f2060 boost
@f2120 tp -338.4 -87.7 -6.7
@f2160 boost
@f2220 tp -338.4 -87.7 -6.7
@f2260 boost
# ---- one more held-charge sunburst from inside the swarm
@f2290 tp -338.4 -87.7 -6.7
@f2295 press a 0
@f2400 stick 0 0
# ---- more light charged shots with the cannon ball still owned
@f2300 press x 30
@f2340 beam light
@f2380 shoot u041d charged
@f2440 shoot u041d charged
@f2500 shoot u04ff charged
# ---- Phase C: cannonBall taken away, standing touches and a boost
@f2560 take cannonBall 1
@f2600 beam power
@f2620 press x 30
@f2640 tp -338.4 -87.7 -6.7
@f2700 boost
@f2760 tp -338.4 -87.7 -6.7
@f2820 press x 30
@f2860 tp -338.4 -87.7 -6.7
@f2900 shoot u041d
@f2960 shoot u041d charged
@f3020 noise 6
@f3060 tp -338.4 -87.7 -6.7
@f3120 obj u041d
